'''Green Marble''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is green in color with a marble texture, hence the name. The guard and handle are solid black.

== Trivia ==
*It has an orange variant released the year prior under the name [[Orange Marble]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Marble Set|Marble Set]].
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/1133366830/GreenMarble here].
*As of the [[Easter Event 2023]], a new white [[Marble]] knife has been released.

